      "priority": "P2"
    },
    {
      "title": "Inconsistent error messages in translations",
      "body": "Several translations in the diff show inconsistent HTML tag usage (e.g., `<br/>` vs `<br />`) and malformed HTML (e.g., missing closing tags). While these are caught by the sanitizer, they indicate poor quality control in translations that should be addressed at the source.",
